# API key from https://currencyapi.com (free tier: 300 requests/month).
# Optional — without it the app falls back to the keyless Frankfurter API.
#
# NOTE: this is a browser-only app, so anything prefixed with VITE_ is inlined
# into the production bundle and is readable by anyone who visits the site.
# Use a key you are happy to have public, and restrict it by domain in the
# CurrencyAPI dashboard. For a truly secret key you need a server-side proxy.
VITE_CURRENCY_API_KEY=
